Laya preprocessing and decision semantics
=========================================

The sequence construction, decoding and window-selection semantics in
src/decision/{encode,decode,long}.rs are adapted from:
https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya
Revision: 8a6e1328cce2460a0e5aa348ad465bb1b5821cd2
Source files: laya/common.py, laya/agent.py, laya/calibrate.py
Upstream project: Laya, Convai Innovations
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see licenses/laya-Apache-2.0.txt).

Modifications: Rust implementation, owned typed requests, checked request
