Bark speech preprocessing
=========================

The native frontend/filterbank follows ONNX ASR 0.12.0:
https://github.com/istupakov/onnx-asr
Revision: b9e0ce0ae3223b3d24ce5a22a5e701a726ca35fc
License: MIT (assets/bark/LICENSE).

The x86 float32 logarithm follows NumPy 2.5.4's fused rational approximation:
https://github.com/numpy/numpy/tree/v2.5.4
License: BSD-3-Clause (assets/bark/NUMPY-LICENSE).

Optional asr-resample-soxr links pinned soxr-sys 0.1.3 with LGPL-2.1 libsoxr
native code. See assets/bark/SOXR-LICENCE and tools/bark/README.md. It is off
by default; the Rust binding's Apache-2.0 metadata does not replace C licenses.

Bark model weights are distributed separately under CC-BY-4.0 by Conway
Research. Their LICENSE is retained and hash-validated in the downloaded bundle.
